Description: Live wallpapers for Linux — video, GIF, image, slideshow, and playlist
 wallpapers with hardware-accelerated playback
 Fresco sets videos, GIFs, images, slideshows, and video playlists as your
 desktop wallpaper. Pick media in a simple app, click Set, close the app — the
 wallpaper keeps playing and restores on login. Hardware-accelerated decoding
 keeps CPU usage near zero without degrading quality.
 .
 一个好用、稳定的动态壁纸播放与管理软件。支持视频、GIF、图片和幻灯片壁纸，硬件加速播放，壁纸库分类管理。

